==Scots==

===Noun===
'''deej'''

# {{context|pejorative|slang|lang=sco}} A child with [[special needs]]; by extension, a person of low [[intelligence]] or having the appearance of a person with special needs.
# {{context|pejorative|lang=sco}} Someone who is deemed to be a [[failure]] by their [[peers]].
# {{context|pejorative|lang=sco}} Used in similar manner to the Scots word [[glaikit]].

